  "description": "XOYQIM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C30 H53 Eu4 N5 O26 8+,8(Cl1 O4 1-),6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.786-3.965 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.72-110.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C30H65Cl8Eu4N5O64. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
